@startuml 06-tactical-order-state-as-is

' Model: As-Is
' UE baseline: dead903156946ec6956342f02d587612baab1717
' AI service baseline: f548c1ad64c5d284eace084132616d171d45403f
' Evidence: UE-ORDER-001, UE-ALICE-BP-001, UE-HEALTH-001,
'           UE-COMBAT-STATE-001

title 战术订单组件状态（As-Is）

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FE
  BorderColor #315A93
  FontColor #172554
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DB
  BorderColor #9A7B16
}

[*] --> NoEncounter

state "无进行中遭遇\nEncounterActive=false\nHasActiveOrder=false" as NoEncounter
state "遭遇中 / 无活动订单\nEncounterActive=true\nHasActiveOrder=false" as EncounterIdle
state "遭遇中 / 有活动订单\nEncounterActive=true\nHasActiveOrder=true" as ActiveOrder

NoEncounter --> EncounterIdle : BeginEncounter()\n重置 ActiveOrder
NoEncounter --> NoEncounter : TryAcceptOrder()\n校验后因无遭遇而拒绝

EncounterIdle --> ActiveOrder : TryAcceptOrder()\n[ValidateOrder 通过]
EncounterIdle --> EncounterIdle : TryAcceptOrder()\n[ValidateOrder 失败]

ActiveOrder --> ActiveOrder : TryAcceptOrder()\n[新 Priority > 当前 Priority]\n替换活动订单
ActiveOrder --> ActiveOrder : TryAcceptOrder()\n[重复 ID 或 Priority <= 当前]\n拒绝并保留原订单
ActiveOrder --> ActiveOrder : ValidateActiveOrderAtTrigger()\n[通过或拒绝；均不清除订单]
ActiveOrder --> EncounterIdle : CompleteActiveOrder()
ActiveOrder --> EncounterIdle : CancelActiveOrder(Reason)

EncounterIdle --> NoEncounter : EndEncounter()\n清空订单
ActiveOrder --> NoEncounter : EndEncounter()\n清空订单

note right of ActiveOrder
  接受前 ValidateOrder 检查：
  - Owner 是 Companion 且 agent_id 匹配
  - AI Controller 有效且 Companion 未死亡
  - intent / then / expires 类型已实现
  - AbilityId 在组件白名单中
  - 条件主体与目标选择器可解析

  触发时二次检查：
  - 遭遇与活动订单仍有效
  - 条件施法结构正确
  - 目标存活、距离合法
  - 资源足够、技能不在冷却
  - Companion 状态为 Idle 或 Combat
end note

note bottom of NoEncounter
  这是 UTacticalOrderComponent 内两个 bool 与 ActiveOrder
  组合出的实际状态，不是源码中额外声明的枚举。
end note

note bottom of ActiveOrder
  BP_AliceCompanion 已挂载 TacticalOrder，
  但 EventGraph 为空，BT_Alice 也未读取订单。
  因此本状态机只描述订单组件，不代表技能已经执行。
end note

@enduml
